 # shared Lean project does. The lakefile requires Mathlib at `master`; the *exact* head is
 # pinned by `lake-manifest.json` (which `lake build` resolves from) together with the
 # `lean-toolchain` Mathlib pins, and this job moves those two files to each new head.
